{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/KTNVLasVegas/posts/several-utah-residents-claimed-that-they-were-unable-to-vote-in-the-june-23-prim/1666529082182478/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/KTNVLasVegas/posts/several-utah-residents-claimed-that-they-were-unable-to-vote-in-the-june-23-prim/1666529082182478/","title":"KTNV Channel 13 Las Vegas","description":"Several Utah residents claimed that they were unable to vote in the June 23 primary after failing to receive their ballots through the mail. 🔗⬇️","language":"en","text":"Several Utah residents claimed that they were unable to vote in the June 23 primary after failing to receive their ballots through the mail.\n\nAll reactions:\n\n62 comments\n\n4 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nKTNV.COM\n\nDepartment of Justice charges Utah postal worker with disposing mail-in ballots in the trash\n\n### Department of Justice charges Utah postal worker with disposing mail-in ballots in the trash\n\nGabriel Gentile\n\nDrop...\n\nIt...\n\nOff...\n\nIn...\n\nPerson!\n\n3\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nKatrina Weaver\n\nI wonder what party the postal worker belongs to?\n\nGavin Bullock\n\nBut mail in ballots are supposed to be safe. Its the only way to go these days. Why vote in person?\n\n7\n\nView all 5 replies\n\nDiego Mejia\n\nIf the felon convicted in chief is able to vote by mail, why can’t the rest of us do it?\n\n15\n\nView all 20 replies\n\nJoy Lane\n\nproblem is when he's found guilty in federal court, Trump will pardon him... where are the consequences? Maybe he will be shamed by his community? I hope certainly not celebrated.\n\n4\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nPhilip Burger\n\n300 people did not receive their mail-in ballots.\n\nMichelle Lorraine\n\nHeaven forbid making a phone call.\n\nView all 3 replies\n\nMost relevant is selected, so some comments may have been filtered out.","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":1709.6534180000162,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}